# Development roadmap / خارطة الطريق

> Directional plans, not a release promise. The existence of a development stage does not mean its features have passed production security review.

## Current focus

- Account Security Advisor UI and status explanations
- Password hint and generation experience
- Provider-authorized account checks where supported, including GitHub
- Appwrite account sessions: clear distinction between sessions and distinct devices

## Planned before production release

- Security notifications and change history
- Appwrite security-data integration, access-control and audit review
- End-to-end Android security, regression and performance testing
- Google Play Billing migration and official eligible Play promotion codes
- Privacy disclosure finalization and release provenance verification

## Boundaries

A provider login or OAuth approval does not automatically grant access to passkey enrollment, connected-device counts or 2FA status for every account. Unsupported findings must remain unavailable rather than being guessed.

